    "title": "AP POLYCET 2025 Seat Allotment Result Announcement",
    "text": "• The AP POLYCET 2025 seat allotment result will be released on July 10, 2025.\n• Candidates can check the result on the official website: polycet.ap.gov.in.\n• The seat allotment results were initially scheduled for July 9 but were delayed.\n• To check the result, candidates must enter their login IDs, hall ticket numbers, passwords, and dates of birth.\n• Candidates are required to report to colleges after the allotment result.\n• Reporting dates are expected to change due to the delay in the allotment result.\n• The tuition fee is ₹4700 for government and aided polytechnics and ₹25000 per annum for private unaided polytechnics and second shift engineering colleges.\n• Tuition fee reimbursement for eligible candidates will follow government orders from Andhra Pradesh.\n• Steps to check the seat allotment results include visiting the official website, clicking the result link, logging in, and downloading the result.",
